"The autopilot includes a DroneCAN power module and battery monitor, "
":ref:`common-can-pmu`. Connect to the Power C port and its already pre-"
"configured for use. If you are using an analog battery monitor instead, "
"connect to the Power A connector and set the following parameters (if used "
"as second monitor use the BATT2 parameters instead):"
msgstr ""
"飞控内置 DroneCAN 电源模块和电池监控器 :ref:`common-can-pmu`。连接到 Power C "
"端口后已预先配置好可直接使用。如果改用模拟电池监控器，请连接到 Power A 接头并设置以下参数（如用作第二路监控，则使用 BATT2 参数）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:145
#: dedd189191d24989b99cfc7f21e94211
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:146
#: 16f151ad869f4fa09afc8d81bd89bb16
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 17"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 17"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:147
#: 79747932a1894ce5a3d7d2d94ea95171
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 16"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 16"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:148
#: 38385e3be7dc4eeaa4bce5f05786fff4
msgid ""
"Set the :ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` and "
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` as required for"
" the analog PMU used."
msgstr ""
"根据所使用的模拟 PMU 设置 "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 和 "
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:151
#: 74eda8ab5f344679b2a0c9bbdfa95dbb
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:152
#: a0909f427e9349869d19a86aed7b0888
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚默认映射为定时器输入，可用于所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（这两种协议需要真正的"
" UART 连接）。但 FPort 以此方式连接时，仅提供 RC 而无数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:154
#: 8fe93bccaaa2475890f50f102ad6a3b1
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL6 (UART7) would need to be used for "
"receiver connections. Below are setups using Serial6."
msgstr ""
"若要使用 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机的内嵌数传功能，需使用完整的 UART（如 "
"SERIAL6（UART7））作为接收机连接。以下为使用 Serial6 的设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:156
#: 13d50cf5661649d2949edb314e800a4e
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` should be set to \"23\"."
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 应设置为 「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:158
#: 972271b599d649c6a204ad136975dcdf
msgid ""
"FPort would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to "
"\"15\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「15」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:160
#: 19596776e8c44493afe10fc102ce2d51
msgid ""
"CRSF would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"0\"."
msgstr "CRSF 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:162
#: 436f3267fa1d4bf9a24da69acb1713cc
msgid ""
"SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\" "
"and connects only the TX pin."
msgstr "SRXL2 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」，并仅连接 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:164
#: 1325174e6d2a43318428798511164474
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:166
#: a6db46c747e94eb5ac989e3d0ce3ca3b
msgid ""
"The power rail associated with this connector position is powered via USB or"
" PMU."
msgstr "与该连接器位置相关联的电源轨通过 USB 或 PMU 供电。"

