#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:177
#: 70b21d56a9744f45b5f9cbb2a75015f8
msgid ""
"The board comes pre-installed with an ArduPilot compatible bootloader, "
"allowing the loading of xxxxxx.apj firmware files with any ArduPilot "
"compatible ground station."
msgstr "该板出厂预装 ArduPilot 兼容引导程序，可用任何 ArduPilot 兼容地面站加载 xxxxxx.apj 固件文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:179
#: d1b53ce78db84a418d21d7b32d94aad5
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found here in sub-folders labeled starting "
"with “CUAV-X7”. For the Bi-directional DSHot capable firmware (Outputs 1-4),"
" the sub-folder is labeled starting with \"CUAV-X7-bdshot\""
msgstr ""
"此板的固件可在此处找到，位于以 「CUAV-X7」 开头的子文件夹中。支持双向 DShot 的固件（输出 1-4），子文件夹标注以 "
"「CUAV-X7-bdshot」 开头"

